    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;Sweet Home&quot;</strong> has been transformed into a roguelite game.<br>Pick two weapons and set their unique skills.<br>Take down the monsters consumed by desire and liberate 'Cha Hyun Soo'.<br>As a fan of the original, you'll find a richer experience in &quot;Sweet Home&quot;.<br>Harness the soul constantly challenging you and the random onslaughts of feelings at each stage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/da4a4808d09ec90c844443968659d6fa.poster.avif?t=1729069382\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/da4a4808d09ec90c844443968659d6fa.webm?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/da4a4808d09ec90c844443968659d6fa.mp4?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIVERSE WEAPON COMBAT</h2>Have you ever felt limited with just the spear connected to a battery?<br>Well, fear not! Just like 'Jeong Jae Heon', 'Cha Hyun Soo' is here to wield a sword and slay monsters.<br>Experience the dance-like kicks, unleash fiery Dempseyroll with combat gloves made from tires, or wield a massive scythe modified from a spear!<br>Show off your own unique actions in battle!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/f7a169100c536e654f4510af265c5e55.poster.avif?t=1729069382\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/f7a169100c536e654f4510af265c5e55.webm?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/f7a169100c536e654f4510af265c5e55.mp4?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE MONSTERS</h2>B... E... G... O... N... S... T... A... R... V... E...<br>Remember the woman next door who was always hungry due to her extreme dieting? Or the patient who was always low on blood?<br>From the beloved monsters in the webtoon &quot;Sweet Home&quot; to brand new horrifying creatures, there's a whole array of them waiting to make their appearance.<br>Who knows, this time, maybe even the security monster with a lawnmower won't harm anyone...?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/7e57e2c6dcf84aabd35b1681cf7f654a.poster.avif?t=1729069382\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/7e57e2c6dcf84aabd35b1681cf7f654a.webm?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/7e57e2c6dcf84aabd35b1681cf7f654a.mp4?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMOTIONS INTENSIFYING WITH BATTLE</h2>As 'Cha Hyun Soo' plunges into the depths of extremity, his emotions surge.<br>Play as 'Cha Hyun Soo' painted with passionate love, fiery anger, and exhilarating pleasure akin to a solo performance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/db6b172794b01ea24c673ed603c2f359.poster.avif?t=1729069382\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/db6b172794b01ea24c673ed603c2f359.webm?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/db6b172794b01ea24c673ed603c2f359.mp4?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPRESSION OF DESIRE</h2>With each exploration of 'Green Home' and every monster defeated, fragments of 'desire' accumulate.<br>If you find a stage too challenging, expend the accumulated desires to unleash the hidden abilities of 'Cha Hyun Soo' as a semi-monster.<br>Don't just leave 'Cha Hyun Soo' as a semi-monster.<br>We know the overwhelming power of 'Cha Hyun Soo' when he becomes a monster.<br><br>If it were you, you could fully awaken 'Semi-Monster Cha Hyun Soo' into a 'Wolvermensch'. Never give up.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>&quot;Sweet Home&quot;</strong> has been transformed into a roguelite game.<br>Pick two weapons and set their unique skills.<br>Take down the monsters consumed by desire and liberate 'Cha Hyun Soo'.<br>As a fan of the original, you'll find a richer experience in &quot;Sweet Home&quot;.<br>Harness the soul constantly challenging you and the random onslaughts of feelings at each stage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/da4a4808d09ec90c844443968659d6fa.poster.avif?t=1729069382\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/da4a4808d09ec90c844443968659d6fa.webm?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/da4a4808d09ec90c844443968659d6fa.mp4?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIVERSE WEAPON COMBAT</h2>Have you ever felt limited with just the spear connected to a battery?<br>Well, fear not! Just like 'Jeong Jae Heon', 'Cha Hyun Soo' is here to wield a sword and slay monsters.<br>Experience the dance-like kicks, unleash fiery Dempseyroll with combat gloves made from tires, or wield a massive scythe modified from a spear!<br>Show off your own unique actions in battle!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/f7a169100c536e654f4510af265c5e55.poster.avif?t=1729069382\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extras/f7a169100c536e654f4510af265c5e55.webm?t=1729069382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961240/extr